OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after attack in city
OL,4,Acentre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after an assault
OL,7,Fin Leicester city centre left another
OL,8,Fman in a critical condition.
OL,10,FOfficers went to Silver Street at 01:40
OL,11,FGMT on Sunday following a call from
OL,12,Fparamedics who were treating an injured
OL,13,Fman.
OL,15,FThe man, in his 30s, was taken to
OL,16,Fhospital where he remains in a critical
OL,17,Fcondition.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
