OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire Police said Joshua
OL,7,FKinnear, 33, of Sedgefield Drive,
OL,8,FSyston, was arrested and had since been
OL,9,Fcharged with section 18 grievous bodily
OL,10,Fharm with intent.
